{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_931EC8BA","title":"Lucy was not finished speaking","entry":"Dlg_931EC8BA::entry","exit":"Dlg_931EC8BA::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_9D4AE1C1","articyId":"72057624102701694","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Hey, can you have a word with your staff? I need a loyal customer discount.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, can you have a word with your staff? I need a loyal customer discount.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44352","byteOffset":31110544,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_60093837","articyId":"72057624102701709","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"I've come here three times now. CORA knows why. I guess I just like shitty food and bad attitudes.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've come here three times now. CORA knows why. I guess I just like shitty food and bad attitudes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24001","byteOffset":16958912,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_0A23F3E7","articyId":"72057624102701724","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"I mean, I'm going to keep coming. I live real close. And, you know, I want to support small, failing businesses and help them find their way. I'm all about that. I just shouldn't have to pay as much as the regular customers.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I mean, I'm going to keep coming. I live real close. And, you know, I want to support small, failing businesses and help them find their way. I'm all about that. I just shouldn't have to pay as much as the regular customers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21387","byteOffset":15978192,"byteLength":568}},{"id":"DFr_0EA4B3DD","articyId":"72057624102701734","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"You're not getting a discount.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're not getting a discount.","TextSheVersion":"You're not getting a discount.","TextTheyVersion":"You're not getting a discount."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35966","byteOffset":27954040,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_4EC2951D","articyId":"72057624102701739","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Right! Well, that's a good start. Maybe I can get the rest of my band mates to come by. They will need a discount too, but they'll make your place SO MUCH cooler. There's too many ugly people here.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right! Well, that's a good start. Maybe I can get the rest of my band mates to come by. They will need a discount too, but they'll make your place SO MUCH cooler. There's too many ugly people here.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50417","byteOffset":33414832,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_6B838176","articyId":"72057624102701744","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"I'll remember this. You've made an en